      "description": "The signature: the file in a frame, sized by the media, with a slim footer and quiet icon actions.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-viewer\"><div class=\"ds-viewer-well\"><span class=\"ds-viewer-media\">1200 × 630</span></div><footer class=\"ds-viewer-foot\"><h3 class=\"ds-viewer-name\">og-image.png</h3><p class=\"ds-viewer-meta\">59.6 KB · 1200×630 · image/png</p><p class=\"ds-viewer-meta\">Uploaded 3 days ago · <span class=\"ds-viewer-exp\">Expires in 5 hours</span></p><div class=\"ds-viewer-actions\"><button class=\"ds-v-btn ds-v-s ds-v-copy\" aria-label=\"Copy link\" title=\"Copy link\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2\"/><path d=\"M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2\"/><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-v-btn ds-v-s\" aria-label=\"Download\" title=\"Download\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"/><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-v-btn ds-v-g\" aria-label=\"Open original\" title=\"Open original\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"/><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"/><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/></svg></button></div></footer></article>",
